## Package Impact Checklist Template

Add this to every new package `TASKS.md`:

```markdown
### Documentation Impact

- [ ] PRD.md updated
- [ ] TASKS.md updated
- [ ] README.md updated
- [ ] PROJECTS_LIST.md updated

### Storybook Impact (keel/hull only)

- [ ] Story file created/updated in `packages/keel-storybook/stories/`
- [ ] Story covers all component variants
- [ ] Theme matrix story updated if needed

### MCP Impact (keel/hull only)

- [ ] MCP data file updated in `packages/keel-mcp/src/data/`
- [ ] Storybook links updated in MCP
- [ ] Docs portal links updated in MCP
```

